  "prefLabel": "Rev 611.01 Form PA-65, Alternate Assessment Election Form Low Income Housing Tax Credit Properties",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 611.01 Form PA-65, Alternate Assessment Election Form Low Income Housing Tax Credit Properties. To make an election for an appraisal of property subject to a housing covenant pursuant to RSA 75:1-a, a property owner shall, by October 1 preceding the tax year for which the election is sought, complete and file Form PA-65 “Alternate Assessment Election Form Low Income Housing Tax Credit Properties,” with the municipality where the property is located.\n\nSource. #10968, eff 11-3-15; ss by #13916, eff 3-28-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 600)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev600.html"
